  "details": "When browsing instances after selecting a specific world, there is a lot of unused space.\n \nOn the right in the picture is the proposed feature, where you can see friends that are in an instance (scroll list) as opposed to going to the social menu, selecting each friend individually and making an educated guess if they're in the same instance together. \nI believe this is already possible on the VRChat website, but only up to a max of 3 friends per world.",
